{"unit_id":"DoloresCaritasAngelus__SeekMaid-pet#card-zh","repo":"DoloresCaritasAngelus/SeekMaid-pet","commit":"6be258e8c9ebc304daf64e8397449885288ba032","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"SeekMaid 女仆桌宠是一个连接 DSH 会话的桌面宠物。DSH 插件启动时会拉起 Python 桌宠，并在插件卸载时关闭进程；桌宠通过本机 DSH API 和 WebSocket 监控会话状态与事件。它可用气泡提示任务开始和结束、消息、工具调用、待办、授权请求及问题，也能从桌宠向会话发送文字消息，并在桌面托盘提供操作入口。适合希望在桌面上持续查看 DSH 会话动态、快速回复的用户。需要本机 Python、PySide6 和正在运行的 DSH 服务，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:150-209","dsh_monitor.py:27-57","dsh_monitor.py:117-126","dsh_client.py:66-87","deepseek_pet.py:485-538"]}
{"unit_id":"DoloresCaritasAngelus__SeekMaid-pet#card-en","repo":"DoloresCaritasAngelus/SeekMaid-pet","commit":"6be258e8c9ebc304daf64e8397449885288ba032","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"SeekMaid is a desktop pet for DSH sessions. Its plugin starts the Python app with DSH and stops it on unload. The pet monitors session events, shows task and message alerts, and can send prompts to a session. It needs Python, PySide6, and a local DSH service; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:150-209","dsh_monitor.py:27-57","dsh_monitor.py:117-126","dsh_client.py:66-87","deepseek_pet.py:485-538"]}
